abstract: >-
  SentinelEdge is a local-first, autonomous industrial anomaly detection and
  self-healing stream engine built with native WHATWG Web Streams, a Z-Score
  evaluator, a remediation state machine, and an enterprise dark-mode Next.js
  dashboard. It runs entirely offline with zero external stream libraries and
  sub-millisecond evaluation latency.
